<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111135" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλοδοξ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>love fame, seek honour,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>
			<i>for</i> or <i>in</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1387b35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφροσύνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					31.28.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. εἰς τοὺς Ἕλληνας</span>
			<i>seek credit</i> amongst them, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.16.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ κοινόν, εἰς τὴν σύνοδον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>JHS</u>
				54.142
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸν δῆμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1304.40
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ πρὸς Εὐμένην διαφορᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					31.6.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀριστοκρατικῷ πολιτεύματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					23.14.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					27.9.7
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.125d
			</span></i>; abs., <i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				35.4.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.7
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, al.: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφιλοδοξηκὼς ἐν
				Σικελίᾳ καθάπερ ἐν ὀξυβάφῳ,</span> i.e. to be a great
			man in a small way, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.23.7
			</span></i>.</div>
